                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "31acccd6-10e7-4b70-8cc8-4083dae17f51",
                                "sense_id": "a223a481-245b-3fcc-a095-fa4a106868c0",
                                "text": "De film laat het succes van de band zien, maar ook het geploeter om hun succes te bereiken en de soms desolate treurigheid van een bestaan waarin alles voor je geregeld is."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d9e8d076-a310-40e1-820a-90e18d14ab6b",
                        "source_entry_id": "08525433-5f26-388f-a07e-c744a8a21e40",
                        "target_lang_word": "sadness",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "sadness",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "68665fdb-7ae6-3217-aee5-32b7078324a6",
                                        "entry_id": "ac15c272-5d49-3adb-8727-49cfa74d24de",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The state or emotion of being sad."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e07580aa-a47f-4349-b65a-abc674ac5ece",
                                                "sense_id": "68665fdb-7ae6-3217-aee5-32b7078324a6",
                                                "text": "But sorrow that is couch'd in seeming gladness\nIs like that mirth fate turns to sudden sadness."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "635136ab-677a-4e81-92dc-c659f2196f40",
                                                "sense_id": "68665fdb-7ae6-3217-aee5-32b7078324a6",
                                                "text": "I mean not then under the name of Sadneſs to defend effeminate Bewailings and Lamentations; let them that ſubject themſelves to this weakeſt Impatience, be alſo ſubject to the Lycian Law, that bound theſe kind of Lamenters to be array'd like Women: […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b210ade1-7964-4c4f-9e08-9bcef0103b4a",
                                                "sense_id": "68665fdb-7ae6-3217-aee5-32b7078324a6",
                                                "text": "The survey found increasing mental health challenges, experiences of violence, and suicidal thoughts and behavior among all teens. More than 40% of high school students said that feelings of sadness or hopelessness prevented them from engaging in their regular activities for at least two weeks of the year."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "edb94245-8cde-40f7-8baa-6fa207e904ad",
                                                "sense_id": "68665fdb-7ae6-3217-aee5-32b7078324a6",
                                                "text": "The compassion to yourself comes in validating the feelings your inner child is having –– the stress, fear, anger or sadness — and make adult decisions about the best way to move forward, Lev said."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e926c19d-a8e5-331a-ae79-fa68c061dd32",
                                        "entry_id": "ac15c272-5d49-3adb-8727-49cfa74d24de",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An event in one's life that causes sadness."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "737b3017-46d7-48bf-b3e5-0f26066559ff",
                                                "sense_id": "e926c19d-a8e5-331a-ae79-fa68c061dd32",
                                                "text": "She has experienced many sadnesses in her forty years."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "211ff236-0736-4146-b253-3a1cb0cf053a",
                        "source_entry_id": "08525433-5f26-388f-a07e-c744a8a21e40",
                        "target_lang_word": "sorrow",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "sorrow",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a6cc4304-d6c9-3233-8f4a-67090f2b6003",
                                        "entry_id": "b2a0a8d7-d1d3-3157-a49d-5d054f27ae89",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "unhappiness, woe"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fd3c33b6-3c18-4638-8904-1214c72be18f",
                                                "sense_id": "a6cc4304-d6c9-3233-8f4a-67090f2b6003",
                                                "text": "But sorrow that is couch'd in seeming gladness\nIs like that mirth fate turns to sudden sadness."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1bd0748b-d417-4b75-9260-63ba14221604",
                                                "sense_id": "a6cc4304-d6c9-3233-8f4a-67090f2b6003",
                                                "text": "The safe and general antidote against sorrow is employment."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "39ef67ae-34ca-3fae-ab96-b7c59281eaea",
                                        "entry_id": "b2a0a8d7-d1d3-3157-a49d-5d054f27ae89",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "(usually in plural) An instance or cause of unhappiness."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1775e540-5abc-412d-b66a-ef94ae635b4b",
                                                "sense_id": "39ef67ae-34ca-3fae-ab96-b7c59281eaea",
                                                "text": "Parting is such sweet sorrow."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9547d6a3-6dd9-4130-b50d-eb2cfcaf6d3d",
                                                "sense_id": "39ef67ae-34ca-3fae-ab96-b7c59281eaea",
                                                "text": "She had nursed all the children, including Sandro, to whom she was devoted, and my husband was just as fond of her. His going away to America was a great sorrow to her, and she always kept the sacred light burning on a little altar for Sandro all the time of his long absence."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4ceddda7-533a-4797-bc2e-d1c2fdae5c88",
                                                "sense_id": "39ef67ae-34ca-3fae-ab96-b7c59281eaea",
                                                "text": "Vaublanc, in San Domingo so sympathetic to the sorrows of labour in France, had to fly from Paris in August, 1792, to escape the wrath of the French workers."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "sorrow",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "54732213-7918-3160-a671-5a3b210887c5",
                                        "entry_id": "ccfb745d-5017-3062-a5a2-fc2e9c9d74bc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To feel or express grief."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0347e1de-de76-4450-9e73-8183daf2c858",
                                                "sense_id": "54732213-7918-3160-a671-5a3b210887c5",
                                                "text": "‘Sorrow not, sir,’ says he, ‘like those without hope.’"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9ecbfb5e-bc3a-45d1-bd56-c53aff87300f",
                                                "sense_id": "54732213-7918-3160-a671-5a3b210887c5",
                                                "text": "When, as sometimes happens, a lad dies from the effect of the operation, he is buried secretly in the forest, and his sorrowing mother is told that the monster has a pig's stomach as well as a human stomach, and that unfortunately her son slipped into the wrong stomach."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d2dab8a4-a66b-374e-87b6-495d693df886",
                                        "entry_id": "ccfb745d-5017-3062-a5a2-fc2e9c9d74bc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To feel grief over; to mourn, regret."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "715281b2-d4d5-4caf-ae15-54f4fecb7f2a",
                                                "sense_id": "d2dab8a4-a66b-374e-87b6-495d693df886",
                                                "text": "It is impossible to make a man naturally blind, to conceive that he seeth not; impossible to make him desire to see, and sorrow his defect."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
